- [ ] Section 4: G1, G3, G4 accepted; G2, G5, G6, G8 accepted with the conditions in section 0; **G7: section 4a APPROVED**; **G9: section 4b proposed, pending** (G10 deferred to Component 7)
- [ ] Section 4b: G9 v3 accepted (lock only, no seqlock in Component 2; Core 1 attempts the lock once per 256 passes; cmd 18 returns at most 16 entries per call)
- [ ] Section 5: access rules R-A1 to R-A10 accepted
- [ ] Section 6: the list of what may leave Secure World accepted
- [ ] N-04 deferral and limits L-N04, L-TZ accepted as report wording
